00:05:53.289 --> 00:05:57.139
Republicans are pushing this nonstop and they
want to keep it that way.

00:05:57.139 --> 00:06:02.220
They want the focus to remain on Joe Biden
because that's the message.

00:06:02.220 --> 00:06:05.539
Joe Biden couldn't keep Afghanistan safe.

00:06:05.539 --> 00:06:09.290
And if he can't keep them safe, how's he going
to keep you safe?

00:06:09.290 --> 00:06:16.669
We're already starting to see the narrative
