00:06:27.460 --> 00:06:33.009
They're already trying to pose this as what
is the significant threat that this will pose

00:06:33.009 --> 00:06:37.699
to us here in the United States, can Biden
even keep us safe now?

00:06:37.699 --> 00:06:45.910
We're right back into that same post 9/11
mentality where every time you turn around,

00:06:45.910 --> 00:06:53.069
