00:06:56.770 --> 00:07:01.340
And that's what we're starting to see now,
it's disgusting, but again, it's one hundred

00:07:01.340 --> 00:07:04.479
percent predictable.

00:07:04.479 --> 00:07:05.729
This is how they operate.

00:07:05.729 --> 00:07:07.870
This is the way they craft their narrative.

00:07:07.870 --> 00:07:11.139
This is the way they sell it to the public.

00:07:11.139 --> 00:07:16.770
And unfortunately, the Republican Party is
