00:07:32.110 --> 00:07:33.110
whatever it is.

00:07:33.110 --> 00:07:34.949
And they're never on the offensive.

00:07:34.949 --> 00:07:38.130
And this narrative has already been lost.

00:07:38.130 --> 00:07:39.970
It's already been lost.

00:07:39.970 --> 00:07:45.750
So, again, whether you agree with Biden's
